 this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  22 REMOVED_MONTH 96 at 14 04     IMMUNOHISTOCHEMISTRY Addendum     THIS ADDENDUM HAS BEEN DELETED FOR THIS REPORT     RECEPTOR IMMUNOHISTOCHEMISTRY Addendum     THIS ADDENDUM HAS BEEN DELETED FOR THIS REPORT GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number and  right breast  is a yellow  irregular segment of fatty tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm  The specimen is inked and dissected to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm firm mass approximately 1 0cm from the posterior margin  No frozen section done  Dr  Gadd simply wanted to know where the closest margin is  Section code  A  lesion and anterior margin B  lesion and posterior margin C  lesion and deep margin DandE representative sections of the lesion Received fresh  labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number and  right axillary contents  levels 1 and 2  is a piece of fibrofatty tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm  Lymph nodes are bissected and submitted in cassettes F I  Resident  ALEXANDER KRATZ  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Najmosama Nikrui  M D  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  Diane R Fingold  M D  PART A  RIGHT BREAST BIOPSY PART B  RIGHT AXILLARY LYMPH NODES   report_end  , Unchecked.
