ion of tan yellow adipose tissue with a suture designating the new margin  The new margin is inked black  the specimen is serially sectioned and entirely submitted in cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Also received in the same container  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm aggregate of tan yellow fragmented adipose tissue which is submitted in toto in cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and   left breast re excision   are two portions of tan yellow  focally hemorrhagic adipose tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 1cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm  Each portion of tissue has a suture designating the new margin  The new margin is inked black and the specimens are serially sectioned to reveal a tan yellow  focally hemorrhagic and focally fibrotic and distally focally areas of yellow fat necrosis  No masses or lesions are identified   The specimen is entirely submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Entire smaller tissue   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Entire larger tissue  Gross Dictation by Tara A Shea  on REMOVED_DATE Micro Dx Dictation by Stewart M Knoepp M D   on REMOVED_DATE Final Review by Christine Garcia M D   on REMOVED_DATE Final Diagnosis by Christine Garcia M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A  BREAST  LEFT   EXCISION PART B  BREAST  LEFT  SUPERIOR FINAL SHAVED MARGIN   EXCISION PART C  BREAST  LEFT  MEDIAL FINAL SHAVED MARGIN   EXCISION PART D  BREAST  LEFT   RE EXCISION , Unchecked.
