s for fat necrosis  measuring up to 0 3cm in diameter  2cm medial to the biopsy cavity is a 3 x 1 x 0 5cm area of white fibrous tissue  with punctate hemorrhages interspersed among the tissue  This area is not grossly suspicious for carcinoma  This tissue is 2cm deep to the skin ellipse  and 5cm from the nearest margin  that being the deep margin  Located 10cm medial and 3 5cm from the deep superior margin is a 0 3cm hard  tan nodule with associated fibrous tissue  Dense fibrous tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x 1cm in dimension is present at the medial deep margin  Section Code  A E  biopsy cavity and surrounding breast tissue  representative sections  F  deep margin  the closest margin to the biopsy cavity  representative section  G H  fibrous tissue located 3cm lateral to the biopsy cavity  representative sections  I  fibrous tissue  the medial deep margin  J  tissue lateral and adjacent to the biopsy cavity  representative sections  K  fibrous tissue posterior to the biopsy cavity  representative sections  L  nipple from the trisected end  M  representative sections of areolar and deep tissue  representative sections  N  recent scar  cross section  representative section  O  distant scar  cross section  representative section  P Q  representative tissue 2cm from the posterior deep margin  Resident  Douglas B  Flieder  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MEEI INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Wiley W Souba Jr   M D  PART    RIGHT BREAST   report_end  , Unchecked.
