ymph nodes are identified  Representative sections are submitted as follows  SECTION CODE A B  Biopsy cavity to posterior margin C D  Biopsy cavity E F  Fibrous tissue away from cavity G  Posterior margin to gritty areas H J  Sequential sections of a 6cm area of gritty fibrosis  from superior to inferior Gross Description by  JENNIFER NASH Resident  RESIDENT FREE SERVICE  MJF                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART   BREAST RIGHT  SIMPLE MASTECTOMY , Unchecked.
