ed the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  05 REMOVED_MONTH 97 at 16 06 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 8cm piece of fibrofatty tissue  inked and sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm ill defined hard mass which touches multiple inked resections margins  A representative section of the mass is frozen as FX 1  now in cassette A  Representative sections of the mass are submitted in cassette B through D  Representative sections of normal appearing adjacent breast parenchyma are submitted in cassettes E through G  The remainder of the tissue is saved in formalin  Resident  RHONDA YANTISS  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  BREAST  LEFT   POORLY DIFFERENTIATED INFILTRATING DUCTAL CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  MARISA BALDASSANO  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Robert Henry Young  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Charles Mason Ferguson  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY   report_end  , Unchecked.
